00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:55.440
Venga.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:35.280
(Música, voces y ladridos)

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:40.960
Dámelo.

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.640
Yo voy a seguir un rato más,
¿vale?

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:50.240
